9.1 Production Infrastructure Specification





Edge Networking: Cloudflare Enterprise configured with Web Application Firewall, HTTP/3, and DDoS mitigation rules.



Compute Plane: AWS ECS Fargate running multi-stage Docker containers with Python 3.12 and Gunicorn workers managed by Uvicorn workers. Auto-scaling triggers scale from 2 pods up to 16 pods based on CPU utilization (>70%) and request queue depth.



